        "<math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">Arg</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Arg </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Arg </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></math>, pero <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></math> puede ser.",
