       "html": "<math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math> por tanto, igualando las partes real e imaginaria, <math display=\"block\"><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0\"><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0\"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0\"><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0\"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>"
